{"3960200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms: Missing Persons", "steam_appid": 3960200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Backrooms Missing Persons</strong>, you explore the fates of the lost through a collection of unsettling VHS tapes. Experience their final moments through the warped lens of an old camcorder, piecing together the fate of the lost. Explore yellow halls, hear the hum of flickering lights, and uncover fragments of stories that were never meant to be found.          <br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/b79811a7e8632e7225d14c318f4c3f32.poster.avif?t=1764947017\" width=548 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/b79811a7e8632e7225d14c318f4c3f32.webm?t=1764947017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/b79811a7e8632e7225d14c318f4c3f32.mp4?t=1764947017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avalialbe Tapes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside Rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one of the most immersive Backrooms experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious  world of The Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment: Toggle lights, open doors, crawl trough tight spaces or climb ladders if you need to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Cinematic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tape features handcrafted cinematic moments designed to pull you deeper into the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/17a4e1b3cd6c96548eb1eaa87769fa26.poster.avif?t=1764947017\" width=550 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/17a4e1b3cd6c96548eb1eaa87769fa26.webm?t=1764947017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/17a4e1b3cd6c96548eb1eaa87769fa26.mp4?t=1764947017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VR Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to deliver the most immersive Backrooms VR experience available. Every corridor, every shadow, and every unsettling sound is crafted to pull you deeper into the Backrooms.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/28f4074e6a1c411ff51256e24197e137.poster.avif?t=1764947017\" width=550 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/28f4074e6a1c411ff51256e24197e137.webm?t=1764947017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/28f4074e6a1c411ff51256e24197e137.mp4?t=1764947017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>NOTE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by the urban legends of the backrooms and is fully Interpreted by us </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Backrooms Missing Persons</strong>, you explore the fates of the lost through a collection of unsettling VHS tapes. Experience their final moments through the warped lens of an old camcorder, piecing together the fate of the lost. Explore yellow halls, hear the hum of flickering lights, and uncover fragments of stories that were never meant to be found.          <br>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/b79811a7e8632e7225d14c318f4c3f32.poster.avif?t=1764947017\" width=548 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/b79811a7e8632e7225d14c318f4c3f32.webm?t=1764947017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960200/extras/b79811a7e8632e7225d14c318f4c3f32.mp4?t=1764947017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avalialbe Tapes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside Rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one of the most immersive Backrooms experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious  world of The Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment: Toggle lights, open doors, crawl trough tight spaces or climb ladders if you need to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Cinematic</strong></h2><p class=\"